# Modelfile
# A 32k-context copy of ministral-3:8b, so the context is set on the server.
# Course kit, module 16
#
# OpenCode talks to Ollama through its OpenAI-style endpoint, and that endpoint
# does not pass a context length. Bake it into the model instead:
#   ollama pull ministral-3:8b
#   ollama create ministral-3:8b-32k -f Modelfile
# Then check it took:  ollama ps   (look at CONTEXT and PROCESSOR)

FROM ministral-3:8b

# 32,768 tokens: enough for the contract, one file and one test, on a 16 GB laptop.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
